Plant growth + decay (tick + randomTick where applicable):
- SugarCaneBlock (tick + randomTick)
- CactusBlock (tick + randomTick)
- BambooStalkBlock (tick + randomTick)
- CocoaBlock (randomTick)
- NetherWartBlock (randomTick)
