- VineBlock (randomTick — spreads to 6 directions)

Redstone:
- TripWireHookBlock (tick — recalculate hook state)

Block-entity-bound:
- BrushableBlock (tick — checks BE state)
- SnifferEggBlock (tick — may hatch into Sniffer entity)

Total annotations: 79 (up from 66, 61% of DG2 target).

